<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#RelationRule> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Produzir e depois revisar o mesmo conteúdo"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#articulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewArticulation> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#bindingStatus> "PROPOSED_OPERATIONALIZATION" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#criterion> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CriterionReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#explanation> "A primeira etapa produz o rascunho; a segunda torna esse mesmo conteúdo conferível antes da conclusão. A forma de entrada e a forma de revisão podem diferir, desde que ambas sejam operáveis e exista correção." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#fromFunction> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Expression> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#knowledge> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewKnowledge> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#relationKind> "SEQUENTIAL_REVIEW" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#requiresFact> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanCorrect> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#requiresFact> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanVerifyMeaning> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#requiresFact> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ControlsCompletion> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#sharedType> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TextDraft> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "CURATED_FOR_PILOT" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#toFunction> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Review> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewArticulation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArticulationSupport> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#addedUnderstanding> "A entrada deve deixar informação conferível para a etapa seguinte. Trocar o modo de apresentação não dispensa acesso ao conteúdo nem correção; sequência não é classificada automaticamente como complementaridade CARE." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#bindingStatus> "PROPOSED_OPERATIONALIZATION" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#operation> "Relacionar coordenação de etapas de K28 e alternativas de entrada/percepção de K29 para uma sequência sobre o mesmo rascunho, sob condições do piloto." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#produces> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewKnowledge> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "CURATED_FOR_PILOT" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewKnowledge> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado#ConhecimentoMultimodalArticulado> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewKnowledge> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Articulação situada entre produção e revisão da contribuição"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewKnowledge> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#derivedFromLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado#K28> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ProductionThenReviewKnowledge> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#derivedFromLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado#K29> .
