<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewLegacyContribution1> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "A tabela relaciona barra, formulário, anexos, assistente e TA a critérios/perfis; sustenta K28/K29 e S14–S18." .
