<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewPrimaryContribution1> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptMMI> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewPrimaryContribution1> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewArticulation> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewPrimaryContribution1> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "A descrição MMI inclui síntese de fala como saída e distingue a seleção de entrada da seleção de saída." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewPrimaryContribution1> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "PRIMARY_CHECKED" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewPrimaryContribution2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewPrimaryContribution2> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewPrimaryContribution2> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewArticulation> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewPrimaryContribution2> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "A opção de conferir e corrigir antes de concluir especifica a função de revisão; o documento não determina que ela precise ser visual." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundAudioReviewPrimaryContribution2> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "PRIMARY_CHECKED" .
