<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#bindingStatus> "PROPOSED_OPERATIONALIZATION" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#capability> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CaptureKeyboard> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#criterion> <https://w3id.org/mado#CA38> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#justification> "CA38 fundamenta a rota de teclado; K41 fornece condições situadas de sua admissibilidade. Não fundamenta voz, revisão ou envio da contribuição." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#knowledge> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboardKnowledge> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "CURATED_FOR_PILOT" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboardArticulation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArticulationSupport> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboardArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#addedUnderstanding> "A disponibilidade do teclado não basta: esforço, compatibilidade e percepção do resultado precisam ser confirmados para esta entrada. A restrição é proposta para o piloto, sem promover os registros de K41 a leitura do original." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboardArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#bindingStatus> "PROPOSED_OPERATIONALIZATION" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboardArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#operation> "Operacionalizar a viabilidade situada registrada em K41 para a entrada por teclado; relacionar a exigência de operação ao requisito primário de interface de teclado e à distinção entre equivalência funcional e uso individual." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboardArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#produces> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundKeyboardKnowledge> .
