<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechLegacyContribution3> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado#TD-EV30> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechLegacyContribution3> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechArticulation> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechLegacyContribution3> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "A tabela relaciona barra, formulário, anexos, assistente e TA a critérios/perfis; sustenta K28/K29 e S14–S18." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechLegacyContribution3> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechPrimaryContribution1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechPrimaryContribution1> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptCARE> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechPrimaryContribution1> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechArticulation> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechPrimaryContribution1> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "CARE permite examinar alternativas para uma mesma transição e sua compatibilidade com o usuário; não demonstra igual acessibilidade individual." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechPrimaryContribution1> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "PRIMARY_CHECKED" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechPrimaryContribution2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechPrimaryContribution2> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptMMI> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechPrimaryContribution2> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechArticulation> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechPrimaryContribution2> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "Os requisitos MMI distinguem entradas, saídas e coordenação; o resultado de uma entrada pode ser refletido em outra forma de apresentação." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundSpeechPrimaryContribution2> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "PRIMARY_CHECKED" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReview> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#GroundingApplication> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#articulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewArticulation> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#bindingStatus> "PROPOSED_OPERATIONALIZATION" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#capability> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ReviewText> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#criterion> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CriterionReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#justification> "CriterionReview escolhe uma alternativa de projeto AAA; K28 motiva a coordenação da revisão com a produção, permanecendo candidato a revisão documental." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#knowledge> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewKnowledge> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "CURATED_FOR_PILOT" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewArticulation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArticulationSupport> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#addedUnderstanding> "Produzir o rascunho e apresentá-lo não conclui a tarefa: é necessária uma apresentação que a pessoa possa conferir e um mecanismo de correção. Não se afirma que envio ou confirmação final já ocorreram." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#bindingStatus> "PROPOSED_OPERATIONALIZATION" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#operation> "Desdobrar o antecedente candidato K28 em uma etapa delimitada de revisão, em conjunto com a opção de prevenção de erros da WCAG e a independência entre entrada e apresentação." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#produces> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewKnowledge> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "CURATED_FOR_PILOT" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewKnowledge> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado#ConhecimentoMultimodalArticulado> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewKnowledge> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Aplicação da coordenação operacional à revisão visual"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#TrajectoryGroundTextReviewKnowledge> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#derivedFromLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado#K28> .
